<title>JAPAN: Toyo Ink to issue 15 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Toyo Ink to issue 15 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Toyo Ink Mfg Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Tokyo-Mitsubishi Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   5	  AMT   15 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 31.Mar.06</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 6.Jan.97   CONV TO 30.Mar.06</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 4.Dec.96   INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 27.Nov-3.Dec</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS   A</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on November 26.</p>
</text>
